{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero","id":1362780,"title":"Major Tulsi Gabbard is my hero","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-22T19:16:42-08:00","id":1362780,"title":"Major Tulsi Gabbard is my hero","content":"She is sueing Hillary Clinton for $50,000,000. She is also sueing Google. He ended Kamala Harris's presidential campaign, exposed former Mayor Pete as incompetant on foreign policy, stood up for free speech, and is standing up to the other Military Industrial Complex as an active soldier herself. <br /> <br /> If Bernie doesn't make her his VP he is missing a huge opportunity and the only elected person in the Presidential race that is loyal to him and actually respects him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T19:22:35-08:00","id":1362782,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1356896-i-feel-bad-for-tulsi-gabbard\">Don't you have a thread on this already?</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T20:39:43-08:00","id":1362789,"title":"","content":"Also.... anyone find it odd to praise someone for standing up for free speech while she's also suing someone for expressing a negative opinion of her (and thinking that's good too)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T20:51:55-08:00","id":1362790,"title":"","content":"'It's okay when I or someone I like does it!' seems to be a common refrain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T21:12:20-08:00","id":1362795,"title":"","content":"Omega, you literally already have a thread about this up, one where you refused to reply when people accurately pressed you about how Republicans are actively harmful to queer people and the poor. Do you wanna do this again, or will we see silence and a third thread in a month?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T09:02:05-08:00","id":1364766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1362782#post1362782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1356896-i-feel-bad-for-tulsi-gabbard&amp;quot;]Don't</a> you have a thread on this already?[/URL]</div> </div> </div> </div> Honest I forgot I had it, I apologize.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T09:02:54-08:00","id":1364767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1362795#post1362795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Omega, you literally already have a thread about this up, one where you refused to reply when people accurately pressed you about how Republicans are actively harmful to queer people and the poor. Do you wanna do this again, or will we see silence and a third thread in a month?</div> </div> </div> </div> I forgot about that thread. I go to it and see what your talking about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T09:05:54-08:00","id":1364768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1362789#post1362789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also.... anyone find it odd to praise someone for standing up for free speech while she's also suing someone for expressing a negative opinion of her (and thinking that's good too)?</div> </div> </div> </div> If Hillary had merely said something negative about Tulsi that would have been different, alots if folks have criticized Tulsi on policy and personally. No it's about clearing her name publicly after Hillary lied about her, clearing ones name and reputation is not an attack on free speech at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T13:04:00-08:00","id":1364825,"title":"","content":"Show me one place Clinton lied (to the point of legal defamation no less) about Gabbard. Because what you're hinging this on, as I've explained, is a misunderstanding of a negative comment about Jill Stein, and that <b>without naming Gabbard</b> Clinton stated that bad actors were looking for a 2020 Jill Stein to use to wedge Democratic voting coalitions.<br /> <br /> Since Clinton never lied about Tulsi, and in fact can't be said to have lied at all in that series of comments by any rational reading of them, suing Clinton for other people's interpretations (frequently misinterpretations) of what Clinton said is a direct attack on Clinton's freedom of speech.<br /> <br /> But I can see how you don't actually bother enough with the facts on all this stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T20:59:53-08:00","id":1364927,"title":"","content":"Just to get the facts on the table...<br /> <br /> Clinton claimed one of the Democrats was being &quot;groomed&quot; to be a third party candidate and then started talking about Russia.. When media approached Clinton and asked if she was specifically referring to Tulsi Gabbard, Hillary's spokesman Nick Merrill said, &quot;If the nesting doll fits... This is not some outlandish claim. This is reality. If the Russian propaganda machine, both their state media and their bot and troll operations, is backing a candidate aligned with their interests, that is just a reality, it is not speculation,&quot; basically confirming that Clinton was talking about Gabbard.<br /> <br /> So far as I know Clinton never publicly rebutted what Nick Merrill said, which presumably she would have done if he was just blowing a bunch of smoke out of his butt and she never actually intended for the target of her &quot;Russian grooming&quot; comment to be Tulsi Gabbard.<br /> <br /> *edit* At least that's what Gabbard's claim in her lawsuit is based off of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 02-03-2020, 12:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T21:55:11-08:00","id":1364942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1364768#post1364768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No it's about clearing her name publicly after Hillary lied about her, clearing ones name and reputation is not an attack on free speech at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can Gabbard demonstrate that it's a lie? It's pretty clear that Russia <i>is</i> interested in sabotaging our political system, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 02-03-2020, 01:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T15:41:32-08:00","id":1365126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1364942#post1364942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can Gabbard demonstrate that it's a lie? It's pretty clear that Russia <i>is</i> interested in sabotaging our political system, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't that kinda Victim blamey? can you prove that what someone said about you is a lie? I think Clinton should have to prove it.extraordinary claims require extraordinary evidence after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T16:50:39-08:00","id":1365135,"title":"","content":"It ceases to be victim blamey when Gabbard is suing Clinton for defamation, and thus has to actually present a case, in court, that Clinton was knowingly lying. Keep in mind that the statement being false is a fundamental aspect of defamation cases: you can't defame someone by speaking what you believe is true, or is a matter that can't be adjudicated as true or false (ex: personal opinions).<br /> <br /> Gabbard is actively claiming Clinton lied, and has committed to a process where she has to prove it to a legal standard. This is also a choice by Gabbard, as a civil lawsuit, not a criminal proceeding.<br /> <br /> Clinton doesn't actually have to do more than prove she had a reasonable belief that she was speaking the truth. The extraordinary nature of her claims do not require extraordinary evidence in this case.<br /> <br /> OJ Simpson can't (reasonably) sue people for defamation when they say they believe he killed Nicole Brown and Ron Goldman despite being acquitted at trial. Because he would have to prove they are lying that they believe the prosecution despite the jury finding in Simpson's favor, which just isn't going to work in a legal context.<br /> <br /> Also, it's worth remembering that Clinton is, at this point, doing Gabbard a huge favor by blowing this off and giving Gabbard something to thump about in public (since campaigning on actual issues that matter to Democrats as a whole seem to be a losing option for her). If Gabbard is super-serious about this lawsuit, and forces Clinton into court, Clinton can easily countersue her into the ground for the claims Gabbard has made about her.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T18:55:48-08:00","id":1365157,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1365126#post1365126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">can you prove that what someone said about you is a lie?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's going to depend on what they say, now, isn't it? If you were to accuse me of being a giant alien cockroach squeezed into a human skin like in <i>Men In Black</i>, but I had other posts of yours in which you said you believe that aliens don't exist, then it's reasonable for me to present that and show that your claim of my roachiness shouldn't be taken seriously.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1365126#post1365126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Clinton should have to prove it. <b>extraordinary claims require extraordinary evidence after all. </b></div> </div> </div> </div>Here's the thing: if you tell me <b>you believe</b> I'm an alien cockroach compressed into a human-sized mass, imitating human behavior while wearing a suit of human skin, absent an earlier post from you that demonstrates that you don't believe in aliens, <b>I'm going to believe that you believe that.</b><br /> <br /> That doesn't mean that <i>I am</i> a bug in an Edgar suit, mind you - just that I'm having to carry out a conversation with a person who is prone to believe outlandish things; absent that post in which you express a lack of belief in aliens, I can only undermine your argument by pointing out that my apartment is bug-free, show how none of my friends and family seem to think I've been replaced, and make the observation that <i>Men In Black</i> was a work of fiction, not a documentary.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnd if Tulsi Gabbard isn't prepared to carry out a conversation with a person who is prone to believe crazy things, then she's not fit to debate the President as the Democratic candidate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 02-03-2020, 10:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T19:36:15-08:00","id":1365160,"title":"","content":"While I appreciate liars should be held accountable for it, it would be weird to hold a single politician who doesn't even hold any office accountable for the lies of others when elected officials and their appointments across the administration are lying routinely and getting shrugs in response.<br /> <br /> The only one who would really benefit from it are people selling merch that promotes the lock her up motto. Like Roger Stone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T19:38:25-08:00","id":1365162,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1365135#post1365135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It ceases to be victim blamey when Gabbard is suing Clinton for defamation, and thus has to actually present a case, in court, that Clinton was knowingly lying. Keep in mind that the statement being false is a fundamental aspect of defamation cases: you can't defame someone by speaking what you believe is true, or is a matter that can't be adjudicated as true or false (ex: personal opinions).<br /> <br /> Gabbard is actively claiming Clinton lied, and has committed to a process where she has to prove it to a legal standard. This is also a choice by Gabbard, as a civil lawsuit, not a criminal proceeding.<br /> <br /> Clinton doesn't actually have to do more than prove she had a reasonable belief that she was speaking the truth. The extraordinary nature of her claims do not require extraordinary evidence in this case.<br /> <br /> OJ Simpson can't (reasonably) sue people for defamation when they say they believe he killed Nicole Brown and Ron Goldman despite being acquitted at trial. Because he would have to prove they are lying that they believe the prosecution despite the jury finding in Simpson's favor, which just isn't going to work in a legal context.<br /> <br /> Also, it's worth remembering that Clinton is, at this point, doing Gabbard a huge favor by blowing this off and giving Gabbard something to thump about in public (since campaigning on actual issues that matter to Democrats as a whole seem to be a losing option for her). If Gabbard is super-serious about this lawsuit, and forces Clinton into court, Clinton can easily countersue her into the ground for the claims Gabbard has made about her.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that would be true that they just have to believe that what they are saying is true, except Info Wars and Alex Jones have been sued for defamation for calling the sandy hook victims and parents &quot;crisis actors.&quot; now that case was just a cluster from day one with Jones and his legal team being complete morons. Now since Hillary Clinton is a public figure going after another public figure and that people listen and believe that things she says. Gabbard might have a case. There is a major difference between a random schmoe off the street and someone who has a wide audience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T21:03:00-08:00","id":1365173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1365162#post1365162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well that would be true that they just have to believe that what they are saying is true,...</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahem:<br /> <br /> &quot;Clinton doesn't actually have to do more than prove she had a reasonable belief that she was speaking the truth.&quot;<br /> <br /> I didn't say Clinton has to prove nothing here. The whole bit about Alex Jones? He couldn't demonstrate that he had a reasonable belief that he was relating something true.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Now since Hillary Clinton is a public figure going after another public figure and that people listen and believe that things she says. Gabbard might have a case. There is a major difference between a random schmoe off the street and someone who has a wide audience. </div> </div> </div>This matters to a different aspect of defamation: damage. One of the things to prove in a defamation case is if the statement is damaging. The social standing involved certainly matters to damage in this regard, but the falsehood of the statement overrides this in legal theory.<br /> <br /> Basically this only matters if the statement(s) in question is defamatory on its own. Clinton's social power doesn't make a non-defamatory statement defamatory simply because of her fame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T05:14:30-08:00","id":1365227,"title":"","content":"I feel like something that needs to be said hasn't been said considering the fact that one of the major pushes of this argument is a massive hateboner against Clinton, so as someone who's politics are left of American politics and therefore has no love for Democrats either for different reasons:<br /> <br /> No one is saying you have to like Hillary Clinton, or even not want to take her to task for her own bad decisions, policies, and schemes, but<br /> <br /> 1) Just because someone is against Clinton does not mean they are a suitable person to support with the power and authority to act in the political sphere, or more somply, &quot;Hates Hillary&quot; is not enough basis for a VP, and<br /> 2) Maybe you should actually know the shit someone you hate has done rather than relying on propoganda machines who are literally trying to just fill the air with enough of their noise that the repetition makes it sound true so that people <i>don't actually research</i> shit that's actually done.<br /> <br /> You can criticize and call for not giving power to Hillary Clinton <i>and still suck</i> at being a beneficial force in society. You need more than enemies.<br /> <br /> (Now Clinton being someone you don't want to give power and authority to is a WHOLE 'NOTHER TOPIC, but it had to be mentioned as the Gabbard train goes.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T10:44:49-08:00","id":1365298,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure Hillary Clinton is going to be just fine. I don't know why she's supposedly dodging service, because that's not really going to help her at all, beyond just grandstanding. Judges have approved granting service through Facebook before when the defendant was difficult to serve notice of the lawsuit. Gabbard is making a claim, and it'll be up for her to prove it in a court. Clinton can make all kinds of defenses, but it actually needs to reach a hearing for that point.<br /> <br /> Thing is, it probably won't. I've no doubt Clinton lives in a State with an anti-SLAPP statute and she'll probably make use of it. I don't really see Gabbard winning anything out of this beyond the pleasure of paying for Clinton's attorney fees.<br /> <br /> Edit: On a side-note, you don't need to specifically name someone in order to defame them. Inferring or insinuating has been deemed enough to be defamation towards someone. Clinton's quotes specifically cite another woman besides Jill Stein. Even still if the court is convinced Clinton was speaking about Gabbard, I'm dubious a claim of being a Russian agent will really reach the point of being considered defamation and that damages occurred.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":851,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","user":"Paradim","date":". 02-04-2020, 01:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T11:53:42-08:00","id":1365314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1365298#post1365298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know why she's supposedly dodging service, because that's not really going to help her at all, beyond just grandstanding.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personal speculation:<br /> <br /> Clinton's doing it because it makes Gabbard look weak. I'm wager that Clinton feels this is just a political stunt by someone that hopes attacking her will boost their political standing; lots of Democratic leaning voters don't like Clinton and maybe this helps Gabbard get some VP cred with someone like Pete (who needs support on the left). But right now, Gabbard looks like she's flailing around as she can't even serve Clinton papers. Sure it's not a good look for Clinton either, but Clinton isn't running for office. <br /> <br /> Defamation lawsuits take time. There's no way this would actually be settled (outside of them cutting a deal) before the Democratic nomination is over. That's probably what Clinton is waiting for. Once there's a Democratic nominee, and a VP pick, then Clinton's going to stop obstructing the case, because by then it loses all political value. Then Gabbard will probably drop it or try to settle out of court instead of actually going to trial; exposing it for the political sham it seems to be. And if Gabbard does pursue it, then it's a sideshow to the election, and Clinton can bring her own legal power to bear on the case and squish it over the course of a year or two.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T12:01:41-08:00","id":1365319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1362780-major-tulsi-gabbard-is-my-hero?p=1365314#post1365314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Personal speculation:<br /> <br /> Clinton's doing it because it makes Gabbard look weak. I'm wager that Clinton feels this is just a political stunt by someone that hopes attacking her will boost their political standing; lots of Democratic leaning voters don't like Clinton and maybe this helps Gabbard get some VP cred with someone like Pete (who needs support on the left). But right now, Gabbard looks like she's flailing around as she can't even serve Clinton papers. Sure it's not a good look for Clinton either, but Clinton isn't running for office.<br /> <br /> Defamation lawsuits take time. There's no way this would actually be settled (outside of them cutting a deal) before the Democratic nomination is over. That's probably what Clinton is waiting for. Once there's a Democratic nominee, and a VP pick, then Clinton's going to stop obstructing the case, because by then it loses all political value. Then Gabbard will probably drop it or try to settle out of court instead of actually going to trial; exposing it for the political sham it seems to be. And if Gabbard does pursue it, then it's a sideshow to the election, and Clinton can bring her own legal power to bear on the case and squish it over the course of a year or two.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It definitely is a political stunt. The thing is, Gabbard can push on the service of the lawsuit pretty quickly here (well, as quickly as courts allow). Supposedly, she's already got two instances of where Clinton has refused service of the lawsuit, which would probably be enough for Gabbard's attorneys to go to a Judge and request an alternative means of servicing the lawsuit. Judges before have even allowed a newspaper article to serve as notice of a lawsuit.<br /> <br /> Clinton doesn't have much power to obstruct the case here, beyond the initial dodging of service she's alleged (I'm going to keep clarifying &quot;alleged&quot; here, because we've only got Gabbard's attorney's word that this is happening, I think).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T13:11:59-08:00","id":1365336,"title":"","content":"Quick is a bit relative though. If Clinton's actually drawing this out on purpose, she only needs to keep it up for about a month. Then Super Tuesday hits and if Gabbard still has no traction the months it will take for the lawsuit to do more than be on the schedule means any value as a political stunt is dead. Even after service there's plenty of ways to delay a trial.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-18T16:34:18-08:00","id":1368820,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=UEzSL6asWss\" target=\"_blank\">This seemed relevant.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}